    "body": "## What does this implement/fix?\r\n\r\n| Property | Value |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Method | `doInBackground` |\r\n| Class | `info.zamojski.soft.towercollector.tasks.UpdateCheckAsyncTask` |\r\n| File | `app/src/main/java/info/zamojski/soft/towercollector/tasks/UpdateCheckAsyncTask.java` |\r\n| Specification | `DeprecatedApiSpec` |\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n### Reported finding\r\n\r\nThe finding (`DeprecatedApiSpec`) reported for `info.zamojski.soft.towercollector.tasks.UpdateCheckAsyncTask.doInBackground`:\r\n\r\n> android.os.AsyncTask is deprecated. Use java.util.concurrent or Kotlin Coroutines.\r\n\r\n### Root cause\r\n\r\nUpdateCheckAsyncTask directly imports and subclasses the officially deprecated android.os.AsyncTask; MainActivity constructs it and invokes execute(updateFeedUrl).\r\n\r\n### Correction strategy\r\n\r\nUse the official standard java.util.concurrent direction for background work and an explicit Android main-thread dispatch mechanism for completion. Preserve the Contract-established doInBackground-to-onPostExecute invariant: one URL input produces an UpdateInfo or null, and only a non-null newer UpdateInfo can trigger the notification path. Treat BackgroundMarkerLoaderTask as a separate AsyncTask finding rather than evidence that this bounded migration must also change it.\r\n\r\n### Coordinated changes\r\n\r\n- `app/src/main/java/info/zamojski/soft/towercollector/tasks/UpdateCheckAsyncTask.java`: Removes AsyncTask and its overrides, queues each submission on a shared process-scoped Java executor, and dispatches completion to the main looper. The protected doInBackground(String...) and onPostExecute(UpdateInfo) declarations retain their existing signatures for the required public/protected API contract while now being invoked explicitly by the executor and Handler flow.\r\n- `app/src/main/java/info/zamojski/soft/towercollector/MainActivity.java`: Uses the coordinated replacement submission API supplied by UpdateCheckAsyncTask while retaining the existing nonblank update-feed URL guard and currentVersion constructor argument.\r\n\r\n## How was this tested?\r\n- [x] The patched module compiles successfully (`:app:compileDevelopFdroidDebugKotlin`); the full multi-module build was not completed in this environment\r\n- [ ] Confirmed by a project maintainer\r\n\r\n## Additional context\r\n\r\nI’m an undergraduate Computer Engineering student at the University of Brasília (UnB), and this contribution is part of a research project involving analysis of Android apps.\r\n\r\nI’m happy to adjust the implementation to better match the project’s architecture, coding conventions, or maintainers’ recommendations.",
